=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Rising Solstice} in {z:Western Adoulin} (D-9) to accept the quest and obtain the {k:Western Adoulin patrol route} Temporary Key Item.
* Speak to the following NPCs in {z:Western Adoulin} in order. You may use {p:Waypoints|Waypoint} to expedite the process.
** Pioneer's Coalition: {n:Zaoso} (E-8)
*** Talk to him until he repeats: "I welcome you with open arms to the Pioneer's Coalition!"
** Courier's Coalition: {n:Clemmar} (G-8)
*** Talk to him until he repeats: "What can the Courier's do for you?..."
** Waterfront (near the {p:Geomancer} {p:Sylvie}): {n:Kongramm} (I-5)
*** Talk to him until he repeats: "Good Work. Everything's in order. Now shove it."
** Platea Triumphus (Water Fountain): {n:Virsaint} (H-8)
*** Talk to him until he repeats "The leaders of the six coalitions are all termed "maesters"..."
** Inventors' Coalition: {n:Shipilolo} (J-9)
*** Talk to her until she repeats "If you came here seeking the brightaruest minds of all in Adoulin, then you're in luck!"
** Rent-a-room Entrance: {n:Dangueubert} (H-11)
*** Talk to him until he prompts you with the Mog Garden Menu
** Mummers' Coalition: {n:Nylene} (H-10)
*** Talk to her until she repeats: "If you're a fun-loving lord/lady looking for a good time..."
* Return to {n:Rising Solstice} for your reward.

